<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xml:space="preserve" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="脚车破尼"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="骹车破尼"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="动力脚车"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="动力骹车"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle"><text for="line-35f76651-53c6-49ac-9378-0d709864d810">大雨淋漓单车破胎</text><text for="line-b06b3720-df9e-4bf8-953a-b8a442f12d4a">牵去修理身上没钱</text><text for="line-68c91065-3e48-4cbd-8a86-d73b344c5738">想打手机跟人借钱</text><text for="line-cf67dd0d-6744-464b-bed0-f80189b8d756">怎知欠费停机</text><text for="line-dbaebaf7-6776-42ff-9a8f-a7c13bac4407">想起昨天我那个女朋友</text><text for="line-3f87cd9a-3a80-4fc1-a093-3a42b6ef4313">骗我感情诈我的钱</text><text for="line-3ce55c04-3c22-4c53-9c6b-c28667a7bf3f">说她父亲</text><text for="line-f8f3e024-bae1-4a66-9271-d8813a9ae19e">流血淋漓</text><text for="line-3db39c17-0ce7-4913-9feb-d0e373908d3a">住在中心医院</text><text for="line-83f91031-de21-4646-b015-a4fdac9e1459">作孽啊 我真的相信她</text><text for="line-a0d48233-b712-43be-97a9-ec0a7754fb46">现金硬币存折</text><text for="line-9cdd1623-7dfe-4bf9-9cc2-d954520bd256">全身家产全部给她</text><text for="line-1e701a3b-3a48-4241-87e9-c1f3e7abd244">她拿了就不见踪影</text><text for="line-0a023f14-f097-4668-9284-173c21f15038">作孽啊 我真是作孽啊</text><text for="line-07a20be9-664e-4249-8f49-0cc0f1686848">全身找不到一毛钱</text><text for="line-a3f6b3b1-092e-45f1-87d2-945ff75edbc5">然后还遇到单车破胎</text><text for="line-2f723be4-9628-432c-a304-70761a9e9c20">我决定从此不泡妞</text><text for="line-6db841fe-41b7-454d-a176-480f16d6e8ba">大雨淋漓单车破胎</text><text for="line-2aa9ab82-7a44-411b-a36f-85c6f8cd44ec">牵去修理身上没钱</text><text for="line-c3be754c-dd35-46e1-acc7-6e4c8b43c979">想打手机跟人借钱</text><text for="line-61bf936a-3086-40a2-891e-387b05084673">怎知欠费停机</text><text for="line-3e4f9390-5691-484e-811b-f460c09ebe6e">想起昨天我那个女朋友</text><text for="line-8bab0437-7b64-4367-9252-b64c3a7f3d15">骗我感情诈我的钱</text><text for="line-5214870f-2a29-418f-b566-8c29236d1af4">说她父亲</text><text for="line-df94fb11-0077-4c01-a129-b7febdf5e881">流血淋漓</text><text for="line-42830b3c-5cfb-4f96-a28f-262ae96aabd8">住在中心医院</text><text for="line-30935fb0-8087-44d7-8898-6ffefde7effe">作孽啊 我真的相信她</text><text for="line-93c0ed62-aad1-4b2e-b352-4cf846f86b2e">现金硬币存折</text><text for="line-d8700e93-1970-4311-845a-8604959ea641">全身家产全部给她</text><text for="line-72c23ed9-c64b-4cc8-89d2-29423285d81c">她拿了就不见踪影</text><text for="line-84d289f6-1dd8-4e8e-abc1-df0eaf9c76e6">作孽啊 我真是作孽啊</text><text for="line-facd5c56-ff6b-4ea2-983a-9188ae19174c">全身找不到一毛钱</text><text for="line-59ceb581-6228-4111-a2c5-5aff2d098ddb">然后还遇到单车破胎</text><text for="line-52cc774c-0347-4e26-af5b-9e4330330455">我决定从此不泡妞</text><text for="line-d939d869-7173-4ea5-8a4a-90f73d429134">作孽啊 我真的相信她</text><text for="line-1fd24f6d-8987-4a97-97d7-2ef0ca5d7b49">现金硬币存折</text><text for="line-e58e67a0-5ce6-46d1-88ae-62430a22b622">全身家产全部给她</text><text for="line-8730a5d3-cc01-454b-87e6-79c16b32e735">她拿了就不见踪影</text><text for="line-61b305bb-f3df-40a3-a8a1-03338c6a63b3">作孽啊 我真是作孽啊</text><text for="line-0f7ce037-20b0-45cf-9b5c-7cf7714af00d">全身找不到一毛钱</text><text for="line-8595c871-79ac-4972-8ee0-af52d313a123">然后还遇到单车破胎</text><text for="line-35ecbb7f-50d7-44ef-ae7d-f40284899800">我决定从此不泡妞</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="02:41.358"><div><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-35f76651-53c6-49ac-9378-0d709864d810" itunes:key="line-35f76651-53c6-49ac-9378-0d709864d810" begin="00:11.211" end="00:14.071"><span begin="00:11.211" end="00:11.511" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">落</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:11.211" end="00:11.511">lóh-</span></span></span><span begin="00:11.511" end="00:11.651" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">雨</span><span tts:ruby="textContai